  "notes": "A ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb used in formal and written contexts. Implies the use of force or authority to restore order.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{暴動|ぼうどう}→暴動：15533_boudou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{鎮圧|ちんあつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to suppress a riot)\n- ⟦{反乱|はんらん}→反乱：11860_hanran⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{鎮圧|ちんあつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to quell a rebellion)\n- {鎮圧|ちんあつ}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{当|あ}たる→当たる：01860_ataru⟧ (to take charge of suppression)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{鎮圧|ちんあつ} emphasizes forceful suppression of unrest. ⟦{鎮静|ちんせい}→鎮静：19769_chinsei⟧ means calming or settling down, and is gentler in nuance.",
